Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.63,0:00:05.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）你来了啊，快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.13,0:00:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）克里斯…不，V！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.31,0:00:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《为什么！？到底是为什么！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.18,0:00:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）从刚才开始完全看不到决斗的画面啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）游马，你没事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.21,0:00:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）总觉得有点不对劲。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.36,0:00:38.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）快斗大人～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.03,0:00:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经没法乖乖待着了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.95,0:00:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算被拆成废铁也要到快斗大人身边{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.53,0:00:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这就赶过去～本大爷～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.99,0:00:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底现在跑到哪儿了呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.45,0:00:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快点把速度降下来～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.67,0:00:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为得赶紧找到一决胜负的对手才行！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）话虽如此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.62,0:01:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可这样乱跑一通也…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.49,0:01:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是又踩到陷阱的话怎么办啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.10,0:01:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.47,0:01:10.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有人踩到陷阱了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.27,0:01:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡西科玛琳……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥比塔尔！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.53,0:01:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦～！你是元祖卡西科玛琳！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.98,0:01:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没……没事吧？没坏掉吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.05,0:01:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃！你这恐怖的废品女。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.32,0:01:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这就把你扔出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.50,0:01:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～等等等等～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.69,0:01:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要快点去快斗大人那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.74,0:01:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗那里！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.87,0:01:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错……我也有话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.61,0:01:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想跟那家伙说。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.99,0:01:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥比塔尔，带路吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.97,0:01:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡……卡西科玛琳！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.65,0:02:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.77,0:02:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迟早会迎来与你一战的那一天我早就明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.87,0:02:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）在得知那个真相的那一天{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.98,0:02:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的心已被憎恨与复仇彻底束缚。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.03,0:02:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从那天起…！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.33,0:02:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你伤害了哈鲁特。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.47,0:02:40.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这笔账，你必须忏悔！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.18,0:02:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.70,0:02:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.28,0:02:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻归我。我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.56,0:02:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤行星探路者！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.01,0:03:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着，我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.79,0:03:03.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤太阳风干扰者！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.94,0:03:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.70,0:03:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以通过将攻击力减半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.81,0:03:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.77,0:03:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 唐豪瑟之门！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己场上的2只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.10,0:03:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级变为双方等级相加后的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.97,0:03:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的怪兽是等级4和等级5。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.82,0:03:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此两只怪兽的等级变为９。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级９的怪兽有２只。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}我将等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}级{\fnYusei Magic}９的 行星・探路者与
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.03,0:03:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}太{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}阳{\fnYusei Magic}・{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}风{\fnYusei Magic}・干{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}扰{\fnYusei Magic}者 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}进{\fnYusei Magic}行{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}叠{\fnYusei Magic}放！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.98,0:03:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.01,0:03:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.11,0:03:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:48.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.９！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.93,0:03:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.43,0:03:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天盖星 戴森球！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.64,0:04:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的 No.在哪里！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.98,0:04:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.48,0:04:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此处 已发动的场地魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.53,0:04:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宇宙 frontiers 的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.67,0:04:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽１张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放１张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.95,0:04:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 在哪里？ 那家伙的怪兽…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.30,0:04:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轮到你的回合了。快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.39,0:04:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《就算看不见身影{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.67,0:04:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要那家伙的怪兽被召唤出来了的话……》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.15,0:04:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤光子三角翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.32,0:04:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子三角翼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.61,0:04:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击那家伙的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子导弹！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.18,0:04:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很遗憾{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的攻击打不到我。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.87,0:05:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这结束了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，轮到我的回合了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.42,0:05:07.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.38,0:05:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用戴森球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.23,0:05:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击光子三角翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.36,0:05:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.66,0:05:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你肯定搞不懂吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.51,0:05:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如今我的决斗已经超出了你的想象。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.28,0:07:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇，好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.73,0:07:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是宇宙？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来这里就是太空场地了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.72,0:07:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确认D视镜的识别信号。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.63,0:07:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.65,0:07:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是那艘宇宙飞船！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.52,0:07:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，速度开太快了啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……我说啊这玩意儿根本不听使唤啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.82,0:07:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，真是个笨蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.53,0:07:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇，快斗大人，您没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.57,0:07:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快……快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.58,0:07:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这些家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.74,0:07:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.85,0:07:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有话想对你说……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.83,0:07:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找我？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:08:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 德罗瓦他… 德罗瓦在决斗中！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.97,0:08:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被特隆那家伙 干掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.10,0:08:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德罗瓦他… 那家伙是为了你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.37,0:08:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拼了命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去对抗特隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.07,0:08:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.71,0:08:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德罗瓦：快斗…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.13,0:08:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德罗瓦他 对你！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.37,0:08:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟我没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:27.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.68,0:08:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.18,0:08:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一马先生的儿子。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.47,0:08:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然在这种地方 演员都凑齐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.99,0:08:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这或许 也是命运吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.72,0:08:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也有事想问你。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的老爸，在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.34,0:08:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.05,0:08:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在重新开始决斗之前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.55,0:08:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我所知道的事情全都告诉你吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.49,0:09:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少开玩笑了！我才不想听你说的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，继续决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.85,0:09:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，这番话对你来说也应该有关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.03,0:09:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们家族，为什么会突然
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.91,0:09:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出现在这场决斗嘉年华上？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 为什么我们然后 为什么我们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.29,0:09:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，是对你的父亲费卡博士
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.01,0:09:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想要复仇呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个，费卡博士……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.79,0:09:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费卡博士是快斗的老爸！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.27,0:09:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 你们还要复仇？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.48,0:09:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底 是怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.85,0:09:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的老爸和快斗的老爸……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.95,0:09:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来我要说的话里就有那个答案。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:45.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}距今5年前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.74,0:09:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身为科学家的快斗的父亲 菲卡和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.62,0:09:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的父亲 拜伦{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直在持续进行发现异世界之门的研究。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.01,0:10:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}菲卡博士：咳… 次元的扭曲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在到处都被观测到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.32,0:10:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.35,0:10:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 无法特定位置！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是为什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（拜伦）菲卡…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.14,0:10:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来 把这个喝了吧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}稍微 冷静一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没有时间了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.89,0:10:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在必须马上找到异世界的门才行……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.27,0:10:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费卡……对了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.80,0:10:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除了我们之外还有人在寻找异世界的门呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.63,0:10:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}克莉丝，那段影像。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.87,0:10:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好的，父亲大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.47,0:10:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是个相当有趣的人物呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.39,0:10:40.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冒险家，名叫九十九一马的男人。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.66,0:10:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（一马）真好啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.90,0:10:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里能让人悠闲放松。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.28,0:10:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有在这里，谁都不会来打扰。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.13,0:10:57.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说……也不是没有吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～这设备可真厉害。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（拜伦）欢迎。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}突然把您叫来感谢您能赏光前来。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.59,0:11:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九一马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.31,0:11:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是拜伦·阿克莱特。请多指教。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重力地图加上电磁波波动图吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.44,0:11:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这玩意儿可真厉害。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.36,0:11:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Dr.费卡）没时间了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.42,0:11:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.02,0:11:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至今为止，我研究了各种各样的现象。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但怎么都找不到……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么……有什么东西不够。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.57,0:11:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一马……关于异世界的门{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.59,0:11:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}务必让我听听你的意见。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要找到那扇门人类的历史也会改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想必金钱和名声都能随心所欲了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}金钱和名声……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种无聊的东西我才不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:12:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我必须找到异世界的门才行！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.81,0:12:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听你这么说，我就放心了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.65,0:12:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一马！你……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我感兴趣的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有真正的冒险！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.76,0:12:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是在试探我们吗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.99,0:12:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看看这个吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通往异世界的门出现之后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.72,0:12:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全世界21个地点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}观测到了异常数据。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要分析那些数据{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.05,0:12:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一次门会出现的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.92,0:12:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该就能锁定。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.68,0:12:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}21元方程吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.23,0:12:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.89,0:12:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}答案已经快出来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就差一步了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.57,0:12:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊……可是那一步……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.31,0:12:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（一马）漏掉了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.28,0:12:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.01,0:12:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能……观测应该是全部！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}地点可不只有21个。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.22,0:12:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}待在实验室里有些事是搞不明白的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.68,0:13:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有2个地方…也就是说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出现的地点共有23个。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.03,0:13:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这…这是真的吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.15,0:13:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.87,0:13:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}答案就是23元方程式
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.05,0:13:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）就这样，我们基于新的计算公式{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得出了一个结论。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我们前往的地方{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.71,0:13:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.81,0:13:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被认为会出现异世界之门{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的某个地点。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.63,0:13:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，我们的冒险开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们在这里待命。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.85,0:13:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来由我们去。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.42,0:13:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就我们3个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.10,0:13:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事的。别担心，克莉丝。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}父亲大人…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.76,0:13:53.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我所看到的，只到这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.20,0:13:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从这里开始是父亲讲给我听的记忆…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.28,0:14:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以一马先生为向导
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.24,0:14:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}三人下到了地底深处。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.70,0:14:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜隆：一马，我们真的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.15,0:14:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}觉得能到达吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（一马）目的地是前人未至之地。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.91,0:14:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但正因为如此才有挑战的意义。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.47,0:14:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是一飞冲天。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.85,0:14:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.31,0:14:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是不放弃、勇于挑战的心情。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.67,0:14:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}家人的照片吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.26,0:14:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那小子迷决斗迷得不行啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.02,0:14:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦，我家的儿子们也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.61,0:14:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也有三个儿子。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.75,0:14:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费卡也有两个儿子。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.08,0:14:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费克博士为什么那么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}钻牛角尖呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.02,0:14:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知道但费克是真正的天才。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他一定有什么想法吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.90,0:15:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我无论如何都想{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让他找到异世界之门。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.06,0:15:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费克博士能有你这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.45,0:15:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挚友，真是幸福。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.43,0:15:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挚友吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（费克）「献上两个灵魂之时
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.60,0:15:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宏大之门将会开启」。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然如此
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.99,0:15:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）那之后过了3天。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.84,0:15:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}父亲们终于抵达了某个地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是某种遗迹吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.48,0:15:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.94,0:15:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 不会错的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.50,0:15:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是异世界的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.97,0:15:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是这样的话　那前方通往异世界的门就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.23,0:16:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费卡　一马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.88,0:16:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.29,0:16:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此　为了防止入侵者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.30,0:16:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各种
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.75,0:16:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关好像都设置了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.53,0:16:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西只是开胃菜罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.85,0:16:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从这里开始就得靠智慧和勇气拼命闯过去了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.55,0:16:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧？　费卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.16,0:16:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？　啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.29,0:16:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到这里就是死路了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.81,0:16:49.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奇怪　应该有什么才对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.95,0:16:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.59,0:16:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:16:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（费卡）终于　这一刻到来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.76,0:17:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.77,0:17:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我觉得对不住你们啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.58,0:17:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底想干什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.80,0:17:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那脚下写着这样一句话。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.00,0:17:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}“献上两个灵魂之时
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.13,0:17:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伟大的门扉将会开启”。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.11,0:17:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道……你是打算把我们当成祭品吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.32,0:17:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.96,0:17:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我必须找到通往异世界的门。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.53,0:17:27.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费卡博士！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.85,0:17:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜伦不是你的挚友吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.85,0:17:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}挚友？无聊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}若真说是挚友的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.59,0:17:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就欣然为我牺牲吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.82,0:17:44.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜伦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.45,0:17:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}费卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.49,0:17:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底，像你这样的凡才是不会明白的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.85,0:18:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天！我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.61,0:18:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一马 一马 放开手不然的话你也会……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.26,0:18:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}据调皮鬼小子说 只要决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家就都是伙伴。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.07,0:18:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（一马）对我来说冒险就是决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.41,0:18:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一起冒险的人全都是伙伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.48,0:18:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一马……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.04,0:18:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不会放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.25,0:18:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 你就消失吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.20,0:18:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这份仇恨我不会忘的 菲卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.59,0:18:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是爸爸的最后……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《献上两个灵魂新的大门将会开启……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.07,0:18:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 超量召唤……》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.62,0:18:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我的父亲回来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.65,0:18:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）在异世界的夹缝中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.24,0:18:58.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一边徘徊{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.22,0:19:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只把复仇当作心灵的食粮。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.92,0:19:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 作为代价他的模样已经彻底改变了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.63,0:19:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是 我的父亲……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.31,0:19:08.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如今托隆的样子！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.99,0:19:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.78,0:19:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆……那个托隆是V的老爸！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.57,0:19:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切的元凶都在菲卡博士身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.82,0:19:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这份报应 一定要让他承受！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.13,0:19:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我拥有的只有 哈鲁特……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.23,0:19:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.05,0:19:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}菲卡博士做过什么{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.31,0:19:34.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我毫无兴趣。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.45,0:19:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}继续决斗！ 让开游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:43.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.80,0:19:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 光子斩击者特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.64,0:19:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）这张卡在 自己场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.95,0:19:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.43,0:19:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我还要通常召唤光子海盗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.73,0:19:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子海盗可以
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:20:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}除外墓地里的光子怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.97,0:20:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升１０００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.49,0:20:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他的场上攻击力２０００以上的怪兽有２只…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.38,0:20:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了　快斗的王牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将　光子斩击者和
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.91,0:20:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子海盗解放！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.08,0:20:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪耀于黑暗的银河啊{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.27,0:20:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化作希望之光寄宿于我的仆从吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.49,0:20:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光之化身　在此降临！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.21,0:20:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身了吗　银河眼…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.62,0:20:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《刚才的回合　我将攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.58,0:20:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力1800的三角翼龙被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.21,0:20:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到了1000点伤害…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.82,0:20:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说看不见的敌人攻击力是2800》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么就用攻击力3000的银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.25,0:20:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把它粉碎掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.55,0:20:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）上！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子流！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.56,0:21:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.02,0:21:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧 快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.76,0:21:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你见识一下 我的 No.怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.44,0:21:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么 这到底是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.79,0:21:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.43,0:21:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大得离谱！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.58,0:21:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:21:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连太阳都能覆盖的 超巨大怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.69,0:22:03.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天盖星 戴森球…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.74,0:22:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论任何怪兽都不可能战胜它。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次的对手是九号球 戴森球！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.34,0:24:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）好大啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.62,0:24:16.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}论大小我可不会输！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.10,0:24:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要是去厕所的话也能有这么巨大的……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.02,0:24:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吃饭的时候在说什么呢！！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.13,0:24:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起……

